{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122879","id":4375194694,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBMgsRg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122879","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122879.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122879.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122879","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122879/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122879/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122879/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/085024b7a6d5dabc6cc36083460141544f76b940","number":122879,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix local scale application in AnimationMixer","user":{"login":"owsu","id":139204333,"node_id":"U_kgDOCEwW7Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139204333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/owsu","html_url":"https://github.com/owsu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owsu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owsu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owsu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owsu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owsu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owsu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owsu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owsu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owsu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #121158.\r\n\r\nWhen position, rotation, and scale tracks are all applied to a Node3D, the AnimationMixer would combine them into a single Transform3D.\r\n\r\nThe problem was that the combined path used Basis::scaled(), which applies scaling in parent space. This was different from how Node3D's relative scale worked and from the previous behavior of applying position, rotation, and scale separately.\r\n\r\n\r\nTesting:\r\n- Reproduced #121158 using the provided MRP on Windows.\r\n- Verified the MRP reports the expected scale after this change.\r\n\r\nAI Usage: I used AI for debugging guidance and to help understand the relevant Godot code paths. I wrote the production fix myself (Basis::scaled() → Basis::scaled_local()).","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/